<div class="row" data-bind="with: activeStage()">
    <div class="col-xs-12 page-heading">
        <div class="page-heading-logo">
            <div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="page-heading text-right">
            <h1 class="main-heading" data-bind="text: heading"></h1>
            <h4 class="sub-heading">
                <span class="margin-bottom-15" data-bind="text: subHeading"></span>
            </h4>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row" style="display: none;" data-bind="fadeSlideVisible: activeStage().stageId == 0">
    <div class="col-xs-8">
        <div class="form-group row">
            <div class="col-xs-3">
                <label class="col-form-label">
                    Please select your Department
                </label>
            </div>
            <div class="col-xs-7">
                <select class="form-control" data-bind="value: stages[0].department, options: stages[0].availableDepartments, optionsValue: $data, optionsText: 'Name', optionsCaption: 'Please Select'"></select>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="form-group">
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-10">
                    <label class="col-form-label">
                        Add the name of each staff member in your department that you have worked with to complete this questionnaire
                    </label>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="row">
                <div class="col-xs-10">
                    <textarea id="attendees" class="form-control" rows="5" data-bind="textInput: stages[0].attendees"></textarea>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-xs-10">
                <button id="start-btn" class="btn btn-success" data-bind="enable: stages[0].errors().length == 0, click: function() { $root.nextStage(); }">
                    Begin
                </button>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="text-block" style="display: none" data-bind="fadeSlideVisible: activeStage().stageId == 1">
    <div class="form-group row">
        <div class="col-xs-12 page-heading">
            <h4 class="margin-bottom-0">
                What is this section about?
            </h4>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="row">
        <div class="col-xs-12">
            <p class="blue">
                This section is designed to get you thinking about the types of personal information you collect in your department.
            </p>
            <p>
                To help you better understand the kind of personal information we are referring to, we have already created data categories and added some relevant data types to each category.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group row">
        <div class="col-xs-12 page-heading">
            <h4 class="margin-bottom-0">
                What do I need to do in this section of the questionnaire?
            </h4>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group row">
        <div class="col-xs-12">
            <p>
                Please meet with all staff members in your department and review the entries in each section.
            </p>
            <p>
                You can add a new data category that is relevant to your department if we have missed something and you can also create additional personal information types in any of the data categories.
            </p>
            <p>
                Please tick the relevant data categories against those types of individuals whose data you work with. You may add new types of individuals if necessary.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

